    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43735" root="&#xA;                        منع&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنِيعٌ</span></b> 
                        , from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنُعَ</span>, [<i>Unapproachable; inaccessible:</i>] <i>difficult of access; fortified; strong:</i>
(TK, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَزَرٌ</span>:) [<i>defended,</i> or <i>protected, against
attack:</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَصِينٌ</span>: <i>resistive; resisting attack;</i>]
applied to a fortress. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْمٌ مُنَعَآءُ</span> [pl.
of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنِيعٌ</span>] <i>An inaccessible,</i> or <i>unapproachable,
people.</i> (TA.)

